# Netlify redirects — cut-over map from the live aspectbuilds.co.uk IA
# to the rebuilt IA. 301s throughout: link equity must pass.
#
# Rules (Netlify: nearest match wins, later rules can't shadow earlier ones):
#   1. Renamed/moved pages first (exact paths).
#   2. Then parameterised patterns for the IA families.
#
# GSC data (Sept 2026 export) prioritised the targets: /about/ (307 imp),
# /locations/ (146), /services/ (128) and the old /services/{category}/ IA
# (95+91+72+40+14 imp) all carry real traffic and land on their strongest
# equivalent.

/sitemap.xml            /sitemap-index.xml       301

# Old form thank-you page.
/faqs/thank-you         /thanks/                 301

# There is no dedicated testimonials page any more — reviews sit on the
# homepage and each service page. The gallery is the closest match in
# intent: it is the proof-of-work page.
/testimonials           /our-work/               301

# Rebuild URL architecture: the service matrix moved to /bath-{service}/{area}/
# and the hubs to /bath-{service}/. The KD-era /our-services/* shapes are gone.
/our-services/:slug-bath/            /bath-:slug/              301
/our-services/:slug-bath/:area/      /bath-:slug/:area/        301
/our-services/:slug-bristol/         /bath-:slug/              301

# Service rename: Plastering & Decorating split into Plastering & Rendering
# plus a new Painting & Decorating service. Old slug redirects to the new.
/bath-plastering-decorating/         /bath-plastering-rendering/   301
/bath-plastering-decorating/:area/   /bath-plastering-rendering/:area/  301

